            "text": "theorem regularPrimitive_equation [CompleteSpace E] (c : ℕ)\n    {f : ℝ → E} (hf : Continuous f) {ξ : ℝ} (hξ : ξ ≠ 0) :\n    deriv (regularPrimitive c f) ξ + ((c : ℝ) / ξ) • regularPrimitive c f ξ = f ξ"
